    "chunk_text": "The new Board is expected to provide strategic leadership and governance as Dearo Venture Capital Ltd expands its role as a catalyst for entrepreneurship, innovation, and sustainable economic development throughout Sri Lanka.\n\nThrough strategic investments and partnerships, Dearo supports Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises, helping entrepreneurs access growth capital, expand operations, create employment opportunities, and strengthen local economies. With the newly appointed dynamic and experienced Board of Directors, Dearo Venture Capital intends to strengthen Sri Lanka\u2019s economy in a more feasible way,\u201d emphasized K.M.M. Jabir.\n\nThe company focuses on connecting investment capital with entrepreneurial potential, creating opportunities for business growth while generating sustainable wealth for investors.Dearo Venture Capital Ltd has further strengthened its commitment to sector-based development through its specialised subsidiaries: Dearo Agri, Dearo Education, Dearo Engineering, Dearo IT and Dearo Investment."
