    "chunk_text": "He also called for the establishment of a Joint Working Group to monitor and review the implementation of the agreements. He further requested Thailand to consider expanding employment opportunities for Sri Lankan youth, particularly in the information technology and tourism sectors.\n\nMinister Julapun said Sri Lankan workers recruited under the framework would enjoy equal rights and protection under Thai labour law, including legally mandated wages, benefits and healthcare.\n\nThe Sri Lankan Government considers Thailand and other Southeast Asian countries as emerging destinations for Sri Lankan workers as it seeks to diversify foreign employment markets.\n\nThe agreements are expected to expand opportunities for skilled workers and professionals, particularly youth, while further strengthening the longstanding relations between Sri Lanka and Thailand."
