    "description": "SLEIS 2026 to examine how Sri Lanka can strengthen its place in Asia\u2019s growth networks",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/SLEIS-2026-to-examine-how-Sri-Lanka-can-strengthen-its-place-in-Asia-s-growth-networks/34-797254",
