    "description": "The Delhi BRICS\u2019 summit: Discussing key Global South issues while managing contradictions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/The-Delhi-BRICS-summit-Discussing-key-Global-South-issues-while-managing-contradictions/172-350326",
